          "type": "graph",
          "say": "First, path compression. Finding four walks up through three to reach one. On the way back, four is pointed straight at the root, so the next find is a single hop. Second, union by rank. When the two trees merge, hang the shorter tree under the taller one, so five's tree goes under one and the height stays small.",
